{#
  containerd registry configuration.

  Written on every node when k3s_spegel_enabled is true. The embedded registry
  mirror is switched on in config.yaml on the servers ("embedded-registry"),
  but a node only PULLS through it when containerd has a mirror entry, and
  that entry is needed on the agents as well.

  "*" mirrors every registry. k3s resolves the upstream registry itself when
  no peer in the cluster holds the image.
#}
mirrors:
  "*": {}
